{"id":"655314","name":"凉拌金针菇小海鲜","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/655314/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾仁","amount":"200g"},{"name":"血蛤","amount":"500g"},{"name":"小扇贝","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"金针菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"4-5颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"小扇贝，血蛤，虾。","img":"images/655314/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"干锅把小扇贝煸熟，煸开口，取肉。","img":"images/655314/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"干锅把血蛤煸熟，煸开口，取肉。","img":"images/655314/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"虾化开。","img":"images/655314/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"金针菇去根焯水。","img":"images/655314/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出控水。","img":"images/655314/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"虾仁切块焯水焯熟。","img":"images/655314/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"血蛤取肉以后再焯水煮熟。","img":"images/655314/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"小扇贝取肉再焯水煮熟，堆在一起。","img":"images/655314/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入葱花香菜。","img":"images/655314/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"蒜蓉小米辣切碎。","img":"images/655314/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"油锅炒蒜蓉。","img":"images/655314/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入酱油蚝油醋，一丢丢水。","img":"images/655314/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入料汁。","img":"images/655314/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/655314/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"减脂解馋。","img":"images/655314/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}